        "gu_guts_gu",
        "sys_gu_immortal",
        "sys_gu_worms"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "While raising soul foundation toward hundred million man soul, practice of this move often injures his soul and lowers that foundation, yet the move becomes more complete and he modifies its activation steps with the light of wisdom.",
      "chapters": [
        1476
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "practice-gains",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "His soul occupies an immortal zombie body after dividing a portion of his soul with this method, his first successful split soul.",
      "chapters": [
        1480
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "first-success",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "That use drops his soul foundation from ten million man soul to nine million, and the clone that holds the split soul is half an otherworldly demon.",
      "chapters": [
        1481
      ],
